# Scheduler introspection for the big.LITTLE snappiness work.
#
# With capacities set (608/617/1024) an unpinned CPU hog that starts on an A53
# never migrates to an idle A72 (measured 2026-08-24: 1.4 s at A53 speed, task
# CPU sampled 12x, no move). Misfit migration should do this and the flags that
# gate it — SD_ASYM_CPUCAPACITY on the right domains — are only visible in
# /sys/kernel/debug/sched/domains/, which needs SCHED_DEBUG. (schedstats would add
# balance counters, but the vendor connectivity module's osal.c dereferences
# se.statistics, which does not exist once SCHEDSTATS reshapes those structs —
# so domain flags only).
CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG=y
# Explicitly off: merge_config keeps a previously-set symbol unless overridden,
# and the vendor connectivity osal.c's SCHEDSTATS path dereferences
# se.statistics, which 5.16+ moved out of sched_entity.
# CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS is not set
